   "text": "✗ **H_lasagna_inner_core_unroll** · hypothesis\n\nFetching Lasagna phase contours (cos/grad_mag) for the inner core inside 5753_-7 (wind_a 10..2, 6.6..15.1 cm past the last column) and unrolling wraps -7..-15 will reveal subscriptio traces\n\n*why dead:* [L-PT-001=0] Straight radial steps across Lasagna ridges (wind_a 10..3) revealed strong S-shaped folding of the inner-core sheets (lasagna_radial_profiles.png), causing polar rays to intersect the same fold multiple times instead of tracking arc-length along the folded sheet.",
