   "text": "✗ **H_arclength_contour_inner_core** · hypothesis\n\nUnrolling the folded inner-core wraps (wind_a=10..2) along true arc-length s of Lasagna phase contours (cos+sin / vctracks) instead of polar rays will remove S-fold distortions and expose continuous eschatokollon sheets\n\n*why dead:* [L-PT-002=0] Global 2D Poisson/FFT phase unwrapping blurs across the medial crease disclination line of the pinched inner core",
